{"id":"a4f2105f33","t":"MY LUCKY ENCOUNTER FROM THE GAME TURNED INTO REALITY","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/MY-LUCKY-ENCOUNTER-FROM-THE-GAME-TURNED-INTO-REALITY-193x278.jpg","n":98,"l":97,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality"},"u":1795038731254,"desc":"من قال أن الانتقام لا جدوى منه؟ إنه ممتع جدا! في عالم حيث السحر متقدم للغاية ويفتخر بحضارة لا تختلف عن الخيال العلمي، فقد تجسدتُ من جديد في عائلة روندل النبيلة. ومع ذلك، ولدتُ كطفل لمحظية عامة، حياته مهددة من قبل الزوجة الأولى والأخ غير الشقيق. حصلتُ على دور “مانويل لوكاس”، الساحر العظيم الذي غير العالم. وها هي قصة الانتقام المنعشة تبدأ! “من الآن فصاعدا سأعيش الحياة التي أردتها”","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","خيال علمى","سحر","فنتازيا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/1/"},"2":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/2/"},"3":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/3/"},"4":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/4/"},"5":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/5/"},"6":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/6/"},"7":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/7/"},"8":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality/8/"},"9":{"ml":"my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into-reality|/manga/my-lucky-encounter-from-the-game-turned-into